    {
      "source": "Default is a linked HashSet, keeping the registration order.",
      "translation": "默认是一个保持注册顺序的 LinkedHashSet。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple factory for shared Set instances. Allows for central setup\nof Sets via the \"set\" element in XML bean definitions.",
      "translation": "用于共享 Set 实例的简单工厂。允许通过 XML bean 定义中的\"set\"元素集中配置 Set。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This abstract method declaration mirrors the method in the FactoryBean\ninterface, for a consistent offering of abstract template methods.",
      "translation": "此抽象方法声明与 FactoryBean 接口中的方法相对应，以提供一致的抽象模板方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the source Set, typically populated via XML \"set\" elements.",
      "translation": "设置源 Set，通常通过 XML 的 \"set\" 元素填充。",
      "count": 2
